":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.3112666606903076,"compression_ratio":1.6615384817123413,"no_speech_prob":0.04671911895275116},{"id":45,"seek":21280,"start":219.63999938964844,"end":227.83999633789062,"text":" actions, whereas really the enterprises are focused previously on single human or a collection","tokens":[50706,5909,11,9735,534,264,29034,366,5178,8046,322,2167,1952,420,257,5765,51116],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.3112666606903076,"compression_ratio":1.6615384817123413,"no_speech_prob":0.04671911895275116},{"id":46,"seek":21280,"start":227.83999633789062,"end":231.0399932861328,"text":" of them interacting with a single application.","tokens":[51116,295,552,18017,365,257,2167,3861,13,51276],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.3112666606903076,"compression_ratio":1.6615384817123413,"no_speech_prob":0.04671911895275116},{"id":47,"seek":21280,"start":231.0399932861328,"end":237.32000732421875,"text":" So the leaders are cognizant that something needs to change and that they need to modernize","tokens":[51276,407,264,3523,366,11786,590,394,300,746,2203,281,1319,293,300,436,643,281,4363,1125,51590],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.3112666606903076,"compression_ratio":1.6615384817123413,"no_speech_prob":0.04671911895275116},{"id":48,"seek":23732,"start":237.32000732421875,"end":243.52000427246094,"text":" their infrastructure and they're very self-aware of where they are in their journey.","tokens":[50364,641,6896,293,436,434,588,2698,12,17074,295,689,436,366,294,641,4671,13,50674],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.23440635204315186,"compression_ratio":1.625,"no_speech_prob":0.008845418691635132},{"id":49,"seek":23732,"start":243.52000427246094,"end":250.0,"text":" And so studies show that 71% of the orgs are modernizing their core infrastructure to support","tokens":[50674,400,370,5313,855,300,30942,4,295,264,14045,82,366,4363,3319,641,4965,6896,281,1406,50998],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.23440635204315186,"compression_ratio":1.625,"no_speech_prob":0.008845418691635132},{"id":50,"seek":23732,"start":250.0,"end":260.5199890136719,"text":" AI and 6 to 10% or 23% of them are investing 6 to 10% of their annual revenue in core system","tokens":[50998,7318,293,1386,281,1266,4,420,6673,4,295,552,366,10978,1386,281,1266,4,295,641,9784,9324,294,4965,1185,51524],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.23440635204315186,"compression_ratio":1.625,"no_speech_prob":0.008845418691635132},{"id":51,"seek":23732,"start":260.5199890136719,"end":263.5199890136719,"text":" modernization to take advantage of this.","tokens":[51524,4363,2144,281,747,5002,295,341,13,51674],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.23440635204315186,"compression_ratio":1.625,"no_speech_prob":0.008845418691635132},{"id":52,"seek":26352,"start":263.5199890136719,"end":269.760009765625,"text":" And the common complaint here or a common challenge here is data quality and the ability","tokens":[50364,400,264,2689,20100,510,420,257,2689,3430,510,307,1412,3125,293,264,3485,50676],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.28123340010643005,"compression_ratio":1.66853928565979,"no_speech_prob":0.017436377704143524},{"id":53,"seek":26352,"start":269.760009765625,"end":272.9599914550781,"text":" to reuse data.","tokens":[50676,281,26225,1412,13,50836],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.28123340010643005,"compression_ratio":1.66853928565979,"no_speech_prob":0.017436377704143524},{"id":54,"seek":26352,"start":272.9599914550781,"end":281.20001220703125,"text":" So great, we have the right people in the room, we have the right knowledge there.","tokens":[50836,407,869,11,321,362,264,558,561,294,264,1808,11,321,362,264,558,3601,456,13,51248],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.28123340010643005,"compression_ratio":1.66853928565979,"no_speech_prob":0.017436377704143524},{"id":55,"seek":26352,"start":281.20001220703125,"end":283.20001220703125,"text":" What do we do next?","tokens":[51248,708,360,321,360,958,30,51348],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.28123340010643005,"compression_ratio":1.66853